          url: "https://publications.europa.eu/resource/cellar/cdf1b143-6c15-11e5-9317-01aa75ed71a1.0006.01/DOC_2",
          quote: "In particular, legislation permitting the public authorities to have access on a generalised basis to the content of electronic communications must be regarded as compromising the essence of the fundamental right to respect for private life, as guaranteed by Article 7 of the Charter",
