      body: "On the ProjectVRM blog Doc Searls summarised the standard: individuals proffer a contract from a list kept by a neutral nonprofit, the company agrees or declines, both sign and keep matching records, and both sides use machine agents. He wrote that these could be AI agents, which made publication timely, and that such agents must work privately and exclusively for each party.",
