          quote: "They can also be AI agents, which is why it is opportune for the standard to be published in an age when AI is still a new and rapidly evolving—for both companies and individuals. … For maximized agency on both sides, AI agents must be private instruments of full sovereignty, meaning they work privately and exclusively for each party.",
