          title: "A Vocabulary For Expressing AI Usage Preferences, draft-ietf-aipref-vocab-08 (Keller & Thomson)",
          date: "2026-09-14",
          url: "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-ietf-aipref-vocab-08",
          quote: "An entity that receives usage preferences has a choice whether to follow those preferences.",
          note: "Work in progress; the draft states its contents do not reflect working-group consensus.",
