        quote: "\"Cryptography is the one indispensable security technique,\" said Diffie, who was a part-time researcher at Stanford at the time he and Hellman invented public-key cryptography.",
        note: "The article interrupts Diffie's remark with an attribution; the card joins its parts with ellipses (the second ellipsis is in the original). Each fragment --check FOUND. Date from the Stanford Report URL (030116) and the ACM announcement at the RSA Conference.",
