          url: "https://ee.stanford.edu/~hellman/publications/24.pdf",
          quote: "Each one sends messages to the other enciphered in the receiver's public enciphering key and deciphers the messages he receives using his own secret deciphering key.",
          note: "Scanned PDF with OCR text layer; quote supports the 'thread' (user-held secret key).",
