          quote: "At all of these events I want to share a vision for how we can enhance the ability of digital identity to enable trust while preserving individual privacy. This vision is what I call “Self-Sovereign Identity”.",
          note: "Same essay: 'Kim Cameron wrote one of the earliest “Laws of Identity”'; 'Consent. Users must agree to the use of their identity.'; the events listed include 'the 22st (!) Internet Identity Workshop' and 'the first ID2020 Summit on Digital Identity at the United Nations'.",
